     * @method self using_request_options(\WordPress\AiClient\Providers\Http\DTO\RequestOptions $options) Sets the request options for HTTP transport.
     * @method bool is_supported() Checks whether the specified model supports the current inputs and configuration.
     * @method \WordPress\AiClient\Results\DTO\EmbeddingResult|WP_Error generate_embedding_result() Generates an embedding result from the configured inputs.
     * @method \WordPress\AiClient\Results\DTO\Embedding|WP_Error generate_embedding() Generates a single embedding from the configured input.
     * @method list<\WordPress\AiClient\Results\DTO\Embedding>|WP_Error generate_embeddings() Generates embeddings from the configured inputs.
