         *                                           of accepted values. Default is the value of top-level `$column`.
         *         @type string       $compare       Optional. The comparison operator. Accepts '=', '!=', '>', '>=',
         *                                           '<', '<=', 'IN', 'NOT IN', 'BETWEEN', 'NOT BETWEEN'. Comparisons
